Test-only dependency jars for JUnit 4 unit and integration tests.

**Not in git.** Only this README is tracked; `test/junit/lib/*.jar` is gitignored.
Run `ant resolve-test-deps` once (or any test target — it runs automatically
from `junit-build` and `integration-build`). A plain `ant` / `ant dist` does not
download these.

Optional JaCoCo (`jacoco.version` in `boms/versions.properties`) is fetched by
`ant resolve-jacoco` when you run `ant junit-coverage` (not part of `ant test`).

Version pins: `boms/versions.properties` (`junit.version`, `hamcrest.version`;
keep in sync with root `pom.xml` when merging Dependabot PRs).

| Jar | Source |
|-----|--------|
| junit-* | Maven Central |
| hamcrest-* | Maven Central |
| org.jacoco.{ant,core,report,agent}-* | Maven Central (coverage report only) |
